    "title": "Brookfield Local Schools installs school bus safety cameras - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Camille Sipple, Multimedia Producer ,\n9 hours ago Brookfield Local Schools is looking to step into the future of student safety. The district has officially installed new cameras on the stop-sign arms on all of its school buses to catch vehicles that illegally pass stopped school buses on camera. The cameras were funded by a $6,321 grant that the district received earlier in the school year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
